<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apple Computer lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apple Computer lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney lowered Apple Computer Inc to outperform from buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 16-3/4.</p>
</text>
